graph TD
    START([START]) --> router

    router[🎯 Router<br/>Classify domain specialty]
    router --> searcher

    searcher[🕵️ Searcher<br/>Decide if web search needed]
    searcher --> processor

    processor[🧹 Processor<br/>Extract structured facts]
    processor --> planner

    planner[📋 Planner<br/>Build execution blueprint]
    planner --> expert

    expert[🧠 Expert<br/>Generate solution]
    expert --> critic

    critic[⚖️ Critic<br/>Audit & verdict]
    critic -->|APPROVED or max loops| sanitizer
    critic -->|REJECTED| increment_loop

    increment_loop[🔄 Increment Loop<br/>Append feedback & bump counter]
    increment_loop --> searcher

    sanitizer[✨ Sanitizer<br/>Clean output]
    sanitizer --> archiver

    archiver[🗄️ Archiver<br/>Save to SQLite]
    archiver --> END([END])
